  "notes": [
    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/doccenter-submission/agc-help-publish-api-post-app-age-rating-0000002236201262#section992664711544",
      "text": "此接口用于申请或修改HarmonyOS应用/元服务的年龄分级。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/doccenter-submission/agc-help-publish-api-post-app-age-rating-0000002236201262#section992664711544",
      "text": "接口调用者的角色：账号持有者、管理员、APP管理员、运营。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/doccenter-submission/agc-help-publish-api-post-app-age-rating-0000002236201262#section992664711544",
      "text": "调用本接口前需完成应用分类设置，明确是游戏类应用还是普通应用。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/doccenter-submission/agc-help-publish-api-post-app-age-rating-0000002236201262#section236517415165",
      "text": "本接口请使用API客户端认证方式，请参见API客户端方式获取服务端授权获取客户端ID和access_token。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/doccenter-submission/agc-help-publish-api-post-app-age-rating-0000002236201262#section2357705386",
      "text": "feedback获取方式"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/doccenter-submission/agc-help-publish-api-post-app-age-rating-0000002236201262#section2357705386",
      "text": "该问卷为独立页面，需要开发者通过window.open()方法打开，并监听message事件获取问卷填写内容。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/doccenter-submission/agc-help-publish-api-post-app-age-rating-0000002236201262#section2357705386",
      "text": "调用window.open()方法打开页面，代码如下： window.open(\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/service/josp/agc/amp/ageRatingQuestionnaire.html#/?appType={appType}&lang={lang}\") 其中，appType和lang为参数变量。 appType可选值为app/game，app为应用年龄分级问卷，game为游戏年龄分级问卷。 lang可选值为cn/en/ru，cn为中文问卷，en为英文问卷，ru为俄文问卷。 说明 如果无法打开问卷，请先退出AppGallery Connect登录，然后重新访问该页面。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/doccenter-submission/agc-help-publish-api-post-app-age-rating-0000002236201262#section2357705386",
      "text": "window.open(\"https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/service/josp/agc/amp/ageRatingQuestionnaire.html#/?appType={appType}&lang={lang}\")"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/doccenter-submission/agc-help-publish-api-post-app-age-rating-0000002236201262#section2357705386",
      "text": "其中，appType和lang为参数变量。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/doccenter-submission/agc-help-publish-api-post-app-age-rating-0000002236201262#section2357705386",
      "text": "appType可选值为app/game，app为应用年龄分级问卷，game为游戏年龄分级问卷。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/doccenter-submission/agc-help-publish-api-post-app-age-rating-0000002236201262#section2357705386",
      "text": "lang可选值为cn/en/ru，cn为中文问卷，en为英文问卷，ru为俄文问卷。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/doccenter-submission/agc-help-publish-api-post-app-age-rating-0000002236201262#section2357705386",
      "text": "如果无法打开问卷，请先退出AppGallery Connect登录，然后重新访问该页面。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/doccenter-submission/agc-help-publish-api-post-app-age-rating-0000002236201262#section2357705386",
      "text": "填写完问卷后点击提交，问卷页面会发起postMessage请求，调用方通过监听message事件获取问卷内容feedback，代码如下： window.addEventListener(\"message\", (event) => { console.log(event.data); //问卷内容feedback })"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/doccenter-submission/agc-help-publish-api-post-app-age-rating-0000002236201262#section2357705386",
      "text": "window.addEventListener(\"message\", (event) => {"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/doccenter-submission/agc-help-publish-api-post-app-age-rating-0000002236201262#section2357705386",
      "text": "console.log(event.data); //问卷内容feedback"
    },
